config DEMO_APP_DIALER
    bool "Dialer"
    depends on BT_ZEPHYR_CLASSIC && BT_CALL_AUDIO
    default y
    help
      Calls from the watch over the Zephyr hands-free link: a number pad,
      the calls the watch saw, favorites kept on the watch, and redial.
      The host must already be running and connected to the phone.
